 <giorstergiopoulos-design@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:49:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Weather place names: offline GeoNames gazetteer of Greece
 (neighbourhood, town, region) + opt-in OpenStreetMap lookup on button press,
 source shown, tests (plan 0B.5)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 MotionDeskStudio.csproj                  |   1 +
 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md                   |   1 +
 src/Widgets/Data/gazetteer-gr.tsv.gz     | Bin 0 -> 286814 bytes
 src/Widgets/PlaceGazetteer.cs            | 141 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/Widgets/PlaceReverse.cs              |  96 +++++++++++++++
 tests/Opsis.Tests/PlaceGazetteerTests.cs | 100 ++++++++++++++++
 tools/build-gazetteer.py                 |  31 +++++
 7 files changed, 370 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/Widgets/Data/gazetteer-gr.tsv.gz
 create mode 100644 src/Widgets/PlaceGazetteer.cs
 create mode 100644 src/Widgets/PlaceReverse.cs
 create mode 100644 tests/Opsis.Tests/PlaceGazetteerTests.cs
 create mode 100644 tools/build-gazetteer.py

diff --git a/MotionDeskStudio.csproj b/MotionDeskStudio.csproj
index 9907ddc..fbab648 100644
--- a/MotionDeskStudio.csproj
+++ b/MotionDeskStudio.csproj
@@ -117,6 +117,7 @@
       <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>
       <Link>assets\Opsis.ico</Link>
     </None>
+    <EmbeddedResource Include="src\Widgets\Data\gazetteer-gr.tsv.gz" LogicalName="gazetteer-gr.tsv.gz" />
     <None Include="suite\apps.json">
       <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>
       <Link>suite\apps.json</Link>
diff --git a/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md b/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
index b5df018..e32cd78 100644
--- a/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
+++ b/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ and the process exits together with Opsis. Data of earlier builds is migrated au
 - Microsoft.Web.WebView2 (Microsoft Edge WebView2 SDK) - used to render web and video wallpapers.
 - .NET / Windows Forms runtime - MIT, (c) .NET Foundation and contributors.
 - Opsis.UI (shared controls of the Opsis family) - MIT, same author.
+- Place names for Greece come from GeoNames (geonames.org), data under CC BY 4.0, shipped as a compact offline table (src/Widgets/Data, built by tools/build-gazetteer.py). Optional online place names (only when you allow it and press "Use my location") come from OpenStreetMap Nominatim: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL, under the Nominatim usage policy (at most 1 request per second, identifying User-Agent, cached).
 - Weather data comes at run time, without an API key, from free providers: the US National Weather Service (api.weather.gov, US only, open data), Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com, data CC BY 4.0, non-commercial use) and MET Norway (api.met.no, data CC BY 4.0) with wttr.in (github.com/chubin/wttr.in) as the last fallback. Only coordinates rounded to about 1 km, or the city name you type, are sent. Details: docs/WEATHER-PROVIDERS.md.
 
 ## Disclaimer
